# generated media - never commit
#
# Narration is derived data: it is regenerable from the chapter text, it is
# addressed by a hash of that text, and a single chapter is megabytes. The
# extension list kept missing new formats one at a time, so the directory it
# all lands in is ignored outright.
/media/
/apps/web/public/audio/
*.mp3
*.mp4
*.wav
*.m4a
*.aac
*.opus
*.ogg

# typescript incremental build cache
*.tsbuildinfo
/.piper/
